{"page_content": "N3: Existing information on (developmental) neurotoxicity from structurally analogous substances Structurally analogous substances should be identified and existing information on effects showing (developmental) neurotoxicity must be checked. The registrant must record the findings and justify the existence or nonexistence of the triggers and particular concern for developmental neurotoxicity.", "metadata": {"doc_id": "31373875-0ceb-4c54-a2c0-b3af4c1440ab", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "information_requirements_r7a_en_part_4.pdf"}}